	"data": "Reflection — April 2, 2023: The Seed That Was Already the Tree\n\nChris at 25, 1:18 AM, recording after procrastinating it for \"maybe even more than a day.\" He opens with a resolution: March was passive, April will be controlled. To-do lists. Sleep rhythm. Exercise. The familiar cycle of \"this month I take charge.\"\n\nWhat struck me isn't the resolution — those are perennial. What struck me is that every single thread in this journal is still alive in September 2026, and not just alive —…",
